{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/hunter-the-vigil/185257-null-mysteriis-theories","id":185257,"title":"Null Mysteriis theories","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Hunter: The Vigil"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-30T17:49:54-07:00","id":185257,"title":"Null Mysteriis theories","content":"One of the things I've always found fascinating about the Null Mysteriis is the creative &quot;science&quot; they will come up with to explain the supernatural. For every four Null Mysteriis with an off-base pet theory based on incomplete knowledge of their paranormal subject and a shaky foundation in pseudo-science, there is one somewhere who has stumbled on a thread of reasoning that is genuinely insightful and hints at the deeper physical underpinnings of the WoD. <br /> <br /> So right, wrong, or just plain weird, what are some of your favorite Null Mysteriis explanations for the impossible elements of the supernatural?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2507-caitiff-primogen","name":"Caitiff Primogen","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2507_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1351"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-07-03T08:40:55-07:00","id":187119,"title":"","content":"How to use actual science in WoD, using SCP Foundation and Harry Potter and the Methods of Rationality as an example:<br /> Step 1) Accept that large clusters of previously unknown phenomena e.g. the &quot;supernatural&quot; exists.<br /> Step 2) Gather data.<br /> Step 3) Postulate a hypothesis<br /> Step 4) Experiment to confirm or invalidate.<br /> Step 5) Repeat steps two trough four, until all of the &quot;supernatural&quot; is understood.<br /> <br /> <br /> How to use &quot;science&quot; in WoD, operating like a conspiracy theorist or a crank look i.e. the Time Cube:<br /> Step 1) Start with an explanation.<br /> Step 2) Accuse anybody, who disagrees of persecuting you. and of trying to suppress the Truth<br /> Step 3) Stumble upon something unnatural. For example witness a Garou territorial dispute during a Bigfoot search.<br /> Step 4) Integrate it previous theory.<br /> <br /> &quot;There exist different, for want of a better word, plains of existence. And our world is being devoured by denizens of one such realm. It's inhabitants appear to be able to &quot;eat&quot; intangible concepts like fear and greed. This implies that the true nature of the world is closet to platonic ideals made manifest than what modern physics tells us. How I came upon this tidbit of information will sadly prevent me from further inquiry. I appear to have become a host to one such parasitic entity. An entity of curiosity. While the entity appears to be sentient, its thought processes are completely alien. Every morning it erases more and more of my knowledge to sate its own hunger. And so I leave this record of my discoveries for my colleagues in the Null Mysteriis to unravel further.&quot;<br /> -Introduction to Professor Robert J. Andrews thesis on &quot;Para-dimensional entities and the nature of the World&quot;<br /> <br /> An excerpt from the first page of the thesis, the rest of the thesis appears to have faded with time. Found after Prof. Andrews' suicide at his residence. The manuscript deemed a cognito-hazard and incinerated without further study.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3242-lddstyx","name":"LddStyx","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3242_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"14"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}